  },
  "notes": "Adds device-persistent tracing for the existing automatic flashlight flow: retained raw IR frames including rejected samples, Auto decisions, accepted output and fade events. The first automatic Auto-enabled recorder session is captured for up to 30 minutes; its cache includes raw and rejected IR samples and actual LED output. Records use CRC-protected SPIFFS storage uses two files capped at 512 KiB each (1 MiB total); durable cached records are retained across normal sleep and restart. Each flush is capped at 512 batches of 8 records (4096 records total) and checks its 1-second budget between batches; SPIFFS operations within a batch are non-preemptible and may exceed that budget. Pending records may remain unflushed when shutdown begins and are not guaranteed to survive shutdown. Use paged device export after reconnecting USB to a host for offline review. Hard-power-cut durability is not claimed. This instruments existing behavior; no Auto policy, range, calibration correction, or physical Auto fix is claimed. Existing read-only IR diagnostics remain. Includes the approved LED menu and icon, runtime current diagnostics and notification, and Wi-Fi OTA fixes. The user will install it over Wi-Fi. physical acceptance remains pending. SW6106 charger diagnostics remain paused by user request.",
